## Assumption Challenge

The rows and columns need not be runners.  They may be directed edges, cycles, gaps, wall crossings, endpoint owners, denominator clocks, proof obligations, quotient fibers, cohomology classes, sidecar fields, or low-rank update directions.  The preserved predicate is whether the matrix carrier keeps enough information to decide the tournament or LRC proof obligation.  The destroyed information must be retained, reconstructed, dual-annihilated, descended, or routed to named debt.
